spending money on a commissioner is

192
00:11:08.048 --> 00:11:11.608
more useful than, for example, increasing the capability

193
00:11:11.928 --> 00:11:15.878
of MPI or having an independent animal welfare agency

194
00:11:16.928 --> 00:11:20.128
that is better resourced to enforce the

195
