The future vision really would be a Ministry for Animals, but a commissioner

198
00:11:32.988 --> 00:11:36.508
feels like a practical and reasonable and constructive step that will address the

199
00:11:36.528 --> 00:11:37.288
myriad issues

200
00:11:38.248 --> 00:11:40.348
inherent within our animal welfare system and

201
00:11:41.408 --> 00:11:44.148
deliver immediate positive outcomes.

202
00:11:44.168 --> 00:11:47.948
But in terms of the budget, I'm not quite sure I interpreted the question

203
00:11:47.988 --> 00:11:48.468
correctly. But

204
00:11:49.368 --> 00:11:49.968
essentially,

205
00:11:53.928 --> 00:11:57.548
what am I trying to say? The CFA would sit alongside

206
00:11:57.588 --> 00:12:01.328
existing enforcement agencies and advisory committees and strengthen those existing

207
00:12:01.408 --> 00:12:05.338
frameworks by providing oversight and accountability rather than replacing their

208
00:12:05.388 --> 00:12:08.948
