210
00:12:11.288 --> 00:12:13.528
rather than carrying out one part of it.

211
00:12:14.088 --> 00:12:17.252
So n- Which none of these existing agencies or advisory

212
00:12:17.272 --> 00:12:20.892
committees currently do. So the commissioner would provide

213
00:12:20.902 --> 00:12:24.792
that accountability and transparency, and most importantly, this would address

214
00:12:24.812 --> 00:12:28.612
what is missing, and that's that independent oversight of a system where conflicts

215
00:12:28.652 --> 00:12:31.692
of interest and interest recapture are, quite frankly, rife.

216
00:12:32.402 --> 00:12:32.402
Yeah.

217
00:12:32.452 --> 00:12:36.072
I realize that doesn't exactly answer your question about diverting funding,

218
00:12:36.632 --> 00:12:40.272
and I don't think I'm capable to answer

219
00:12:40.332 --> 00:12:42.082
parliamentary budget questions, but does that-

