00:12:42.892 --> 00:12:46.512
No, I think that's a very useful response because you're essentially saying

221
00:12:47.892 --> 00:12:51.552
the oversight and vision for how to best

222
00:12:51.572 --> 00:12:55.492
address animal welfare issues is lacking in the current system, and a commissioner

223
00:12:55.532 --> 00:12:56.272
would bring that.

224
00:12:57.812 --> 00:12:58.112
Well, that-

225
00:12:58.212 --> 00:12:58.932
That's right.

226
00:12:59.992 --> 00:13:00.672
Yeah.

227
00:13:01.412 --> 00:13:03.632
Just one question. Would you

228
00:13:04.792 --> 00:13:07.872
anticipate, contemplate that this role would take any

229
00:13:07.932 --> 00:13:08.852
operational

230
00:13:11.452 --> 00:13:14.812
functions off any existing agencies or it would

231
00:13:14.852 --> 00:13:17.682
be, as you said, oversight only?

232
00:13:19.292 --> 00:13:20.152
Again, I

233
00:13:21.052 --> 00:13:24.752
don't feel like I'm qualified to get into the nitty-gritty about how

