00:14:07.892 --> 00:14:08.072
them.

247
00:14:08.672 --> 00:14:12.192
All right. Look, thank you very much. Our time is now up.

248
00:14:12.432 --> 00:14:16.232
So look, thank you, and you're welcome to remain on while we hear from the

